id: kaioken-deep-red
name: Deep Red
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1, 2
description: >
  The brilliant scarlet flames that encompass you now answer to your whims.
text: >
  Deep Red: The brilliant scarlet flames that encompass you now answer to your whims.
  (1)-[Permanent]: You gain access to the 4th and 5th Grades of Kaioken.
  (2)-[Permanent]: If you are in the Entrusted State, you gain access to the 6th Grade of Kaioken.
  (3)-[Passive]: While in the 4th Grade or higher of Kaioken, Kaioken has its Attribute Modifier Bonus (IN) increased by 1(T).
  (4)-[Passive]: Reduce the Life Point Cost of all Kaioken Grades by 1(bT).
  (5)-[Automatic]: If you end your turn in the 6th Grade of Kaioken, you must use the Transformation Maneuver to enter a lower Grade of Kaioken as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  (6)-[Triggered/Entrusted]: Use the Transformation Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver to enter the 6th Grade of Kaioken.
  (7)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: Upon being knocked through a Health Threshold by paying the Life Point Cost, you may trigger any effects that would normally be triggered as if it was the result of an Opponent's Attacking Maneuver.

---

# (1)(2) Its 4th and 5th Grades, the 6th in the Entrusted State: said on its Grade box. (4) The Life Point Cost 1(bT) lower: in
# Crimson Sacrifice's.

# (3) In its 4th Grade or higher: Insight Attribute Modifier Bonus 1(T).
[passive, effect 3]
if ($G >= 4) {
    insight.mod += 1(T);
}

# (5) The 6th Grade left at the end of your turn, (7) Threshold effects from its own Life Point Cost: the table's.

# (6) Entering the Entrusted State: the Transformation Maneuver out of sequence - into its 6th Grade, offered on your latest card.
[triggered/state/entrusted, outOfSequence, effect 6]
transformationOutOfSequence();
